---
---

<section class="d3-howitgoes" id="howitgoes">
  <div class="d3-section-container">
    <h2>Как это происходит</h2>
    <p class="d3-howitgoes__subtitle">От первого письма до свадебного танца</p>

    <div class="d3-timeline">
      <div class="d3-timeline-step">
        <div class="d3-timeline-marker">1</div>
        <h3>Напишите нам</h3>
        <p>Расскажите о себе, своей дате и мечте. Можно в Telegram — Дмитрий ответит сразу.</p>
      </div>

      <svg class="d3-timeline-connector" viewBox="0 0 60 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
          d="M 30 0 Q 40 20 35 40 Q 30 60 30 80"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#ff9500"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          opacity="0.5"
        />
      </svg>

      <div class="d3-timeline-step">
        <div class="d3-timeline-marker">2</div>
        <h3>Первое занятие</h3>
        <p>Выбираем музыку, обсуждаем ваш стиль и начинаем с основ. Никакого давления.</p>
      </div>

      <svg class="d3-timeline-connector" viewBox="0 0 60 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
          d="M 30 0 Q 20 20 25 40 Q 30 60 30 80"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#0064ff"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          opacity="0.5"
        />
      </svg>

      <div class="d3-timeline-step">
        <div class="d3-timeline-marker">3</div>
        <h3>Построение</h3>
        <p>Несколько недель занятий, каждое — новый шаг. Хореография растёт вместе с вами.</p>
      </div>

      <svg class="d3-timeline-connector" viewBox="0 0 60 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
          d="M 30 0 Q 40 20 35 40 Q 30 60 30 80"
          fill="none"
          stroke="#ff6b6b"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          opacity="0.5"
        />
      </svg>

      <div class="d3-timeline-step">
        <div class="d3-timeline-marker">4</div>
        <h3>День свадьбы</h3>
        <p>Вы выходите на танцпол. Вся энергия, вся любовь, все ваши занятия — в этом танце.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .d3-howitgoes {
    padding: 4rem 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fef8f3 0%, #fff9f0 100%);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .d3-howitgoes {
      padding: 6rem 2rem;
    }
  }

  .d3-section-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .d3-howitgoes h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2d3436;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .d3-howitgoes__subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .d3-timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .d3-timeline {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .d3-timeline-step {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #ff9500;
    animation: step-enter 0.6s ease-out backwards;
    position: relative;
  }

  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; border-left-color: #0064ff; }
  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.3s; border-left-color: #ff6b6b; }
  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.4s; border-left-color: #f09433; }

  @keyframes step-enter {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .d3-timeline-marker {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1rem;
    left: 2rem;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9500, #f09433);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(3) .d3-timeline-marker {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0064ff, #0052cc);
  }

  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(5) .d3-timeline-marker {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #ff5252);
  }

  .d3-timeline-step:nth-child(7) .d3-timeline-marker {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f09433, #ff9500);
  }

  .d3-timeline-step h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #2d3436;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-family: "Jost", sans-serif;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .d3-timeline-step p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
  }

  .d3-timeline-connector {
    width: 40px;
    height: 80px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .d3-timeline-connector {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .d3-timeline-connector {
      display: block;
      width: 60px;
      height: 100px;
      grid-column: auto;
      align-self: end;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transform: scaleY(1.2);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .d3-timeline-step {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
